### Lax's fifth-order equation
###   u_t + 30 u^2 u_x + 20 u_x u_xx + 10 u u_xxx + u_xxxxx = 0
### exact soliton u = 2k^2 sech^2( k(x - 16 k^4 t) ), k = 1/2
### (verified against the equation in 40-digit arithmetic).
### The scalar Residual language cannot write u^2 u_x or u_x u_xx;
### the System term products (TRP, DXD) can, with one component.
Init_w       Glorot_norm
Nlayer       4 /
2 / (x, t)
16 /
16 /
1 /
Rand_seed    7 /
Task         TRAIN /
Epoch        3000 /
Num_batch    300 /
Shuffle      0 /
Num_validation 0 /
Validation_cyc 20 /
Checkpoint_cyc 100000 /
Loss_term  DATA         100  data.dat    1.d0 /
Loss_term  COLLOCATION  200  colloc.dat  1.d-2 /
System 1 5 /
TRM 1 1  0 1  1.d0  /            u_t
TRP 1 1  0 0  1  0 0  1  1 0  30.d0 /   30 u u u_x
DXD 1 1  1 0  1  2 0  20.d0 /    20 u_x u_xx
XUX 1 1  1  3 0  10.d0 /         10 u u_xxx
TRM 1 1  5 0  1.d0  /            u_xxxxx
Time_axis  2 /
Exact_solution 1 /
GD_method  LBFGS
GD_param   0. 0. 0. 0. 0. /
Lbfgs_m    40 /
